{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Bo listens while he eats. He smiles. \"I aint really got no craft.\" He chuckles as he looks around. He leans in and whispers. \"I have been getting used ta bein who i want though.\" He smiles","created_at":"2021-07-27T10:19:28.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869524384489025536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
